- israel.95.t: "Meeting in Sharm El Sheikh!"
- israel.95.d: "Recently, Egyptian government was asked by government of Israel to mediate lowering of tensions between us and Israel.\n\nBoth diplomatic missions have arrived to Sharm El Sheikh and we are ready to say our first word, which will determine the outcome of the meeting."
- israel.95.a: "We agree to calm the situation down."
- israel.95.b: "Idiotic initiative!"
- 
- israel.96.t: "Successful Meeting in Sharm El Sheikh!"
- israel.96.d: "Luckily, due to efforts of Egyptian government, Israel and Palestine lowered their tensions and temporary agreement was reached."
- israel.96.a: "Great!"
- israel.96.b: "Thanks, Egypt!"
- 
- israel.97.t: "Unsuccessful Meeting in Sharm El Sheikh!"
- israel.97.d: "After an hour of negotiations, Palestinian delegation left the conference and will not continue the talks."
- israel.97.a: "Well... we tried."
- israel.97.b: "Stubborn stupidity!"
